old_title = "Names on a list"
level = 2
summary = "A TOURNAMENT FIELD IN CHAMPAGNE, AND FULK OF NEUILLY HAS TAKEN IT OVER TO PREACH THE CROSS. SHOUT ZAMPANO'S VOW IN THE PAUSES OF THE SERMON UNTIL THE CROWD HEARS HIM. THEN THE GREAT COUNTS TAKE THE CROSS ON THE PLATFORM, A CLERK WRITES EVERYONE DOWN BY RANK, AND THE MARSHAL RIDES FOR VENICE TO HIRE THE SHIPS."
map = "fair"
music = "level2"
